### Teste 7: Decoradores utilitários de string

**length():**
- length("Hello World"): {{ length("Hello World") }}
- length de actor.faction: {{ length(actor.faction) }}
- length de array vazio: {{ length([]) }}

**contains():**
- contains("Hello World", "World"): {% if contains("Hello World", "World") %}✓ TRUE{% else %}✗ FALSE{% endif %}
- contains("Hello World", "xyz"): {% if contains("Hello World", "xyz") %}✓ TRUE{% else %}✗ FALSE{% endif %}
- contains(teste de array): {% if contains(["apple", "banana", "cherry"], "banana") %}✓ TRUE{% else %}✗ FALSE{% endif %}

**join():**
- join(["a", "b", "c"], ", "): {{ join(["a", "b", "c"], ", ") }}
- join(["one"], "-"): {{ join(["one"], "-") }}

**lower():**
- lower("HELLO WORLD"): {{ lower("HELLO WORLD") }}
- lower(nome do ator): {{ lower(actorName) }}

**replace():**
- replace("Hello World", "World", "Skyrim"): {{ replace("Hello World", "World", "Skyrim") }}
- replace("aaa", "a", "b"): {{ replace("aaa", "a", "b") }}
- Sem diferenciar maiúsculas: {{ replace("Hello HELLO hello", "hello", "hi", false) }}
- Somente o primeiro: {{ replace("aaa", "a", "X", true, true) }}

**to_string():**
- to_string(123): {{ to_string(123) }}
- to_string(actor.UUID): {{ to_string(actor.UUID) }}
- to_string(true): {{ to_string(true) }}
- to_string(3.14159): {{ to_string(3.14159) }}

**to_number():**
- to_number("42"): {{ to_number("42") }}
- to_number("3.14"): {{ to_number("3.14") }}
- to_number("invalid"): {{ to_number("invalid") }}

**is_array():**
- is_array([1,2,3]): {% if is_array([1, 2, 3]) %}✓ TRUE{% else %}✗ FALSE{% endif %}
- is_array("string"): {% if is_array("string") %}✓ TRUE{% else %}✗ FALSE{% endif %}
- is_array(actor.faction): {% if is_array(actor.faction) %}✓ TRUE{% else %}✗ FALSE{% endif %}

